{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01411","headline":"相和歌辞 乌夜啼 · 王建","name":"相和歌辞 乌夜啼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭树乌，尔何不向别处栖？\n夜夜夜半当户啼。\n家人把烛出洞户，惊栖失羣飞落树。\n一飞直欲飞上天，回回不离旧栖处。\n未明重绕主人屋，欲下空中黑相触。\n风飘雨湿亦不移，君家树头多好枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}